      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفِلَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>legs</i> (S, M, Mgh, Msb, K) of a camel
(S, M, Mgh, K) or of a beast, or quadruped:
(Msb:) because they are lowest. (M.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَافِلَةٌ</span>: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفِلٌ</span>, in three places.

